TITLE:: FxCubeWarp
summary:: a bipolar knob, fine near the middle
categories:: Libraries>FxKit
related:: Classes/Warp, Classes/ControlSpec

DESCRIPTION::
For a ControlSpec from -hi to hi: small steps near 0, large at the ends. Spiral's shift is one.

code::
c = ControlSpec(-2000, 2000);
c.warp = FxCubeWarp(c);
c.map(0.55);
c.map(1);
::

CLASSMETHODS::

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: map

ARGUMENT:: value

METHOD:: unmap

ARGUMENT:: value

